</code></pre> <p>The abbreviated output looks like this. In the output, the ID is called <code>deployedModelId</code>.</p> <pre><code>Using endpoint [https://us-central1-aiplatform.googleapis.com/]
artifactUri: [URI removed]
baseModelSource:
