Use the Vertex AI API in express mode <p> Step 1: Install and initialize the Google Gen AI SDK</p> <p>The Google Gen AI SDK lets you use Google generative AI models and features to build AI-powered applications. When using Vertex AI in express mode, install and initialize the <code>google-genai</code> package to authenticate using your generated API key.</p> <p>Install the SDK</p> <p>To install the Google Gen AI SDK for express mode, run the following commands. If you're using Colab, ignore any dependency conflicts and restart the runtime after installation.</p> <pre><code># Developer TODO: If you're using Colab, uncomment the following lines:
